<title>UK: Vickers shoots higher on alliance talk.</title>
<headline>Vickers shoots higher on alliance talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Vickers Plc were up 7-1/2p at 267p by 0850 GMT following weekend press speculation that the armoured-vehicle maker may be holding talks with GKN Plc about a possible alliance.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been a lot of talk around that Vickers could link up with another group,&quot; one senior dealer said.</p>
<p>&quot;With the whole defence industry consolidating, an alliance or merger is certainly a logical move.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
